          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaahna wuxuu ugu marag furay calaamooyin iyo yaababba, iyo xoogag kala duduwan, iyo hadiyado Ruuxa Quduuska ahu u qaybiyey siduu doonayay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
